{
  "bookId": "hero-213018",
  "id": "bond-35301",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35301001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "奇怪，我的那件蓝色毛衣怎么不见了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "啊，难道说……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "米菲亚见到过吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "难道说……是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是在哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "是……你到了会得健忘症的年纪了喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "果然不应该期待米菲亚说的话啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但是米菲亚窝里的这团蓝色毛线球看起来十分眼熟……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "那是米菲亚的！上面有米菲亚的贴纸！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真的不是用我的毛衣拆的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "虽然它之前属于你，不过现在贴了贴纸就属于米菲亚了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是严格来说，米菲亚现在也是属于我的手办呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "恰恰相反！你才是属于米菲亚的专属扫灰官！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35301014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "快点顺着毛撸，不然后果你知道的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
